    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "School systems should treat San Francisco’s ethnic-studies pilot as grounds for rigorous replication, not proof that any mandate will reproduce its gains.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The linked cutoff-local evidence finds improved ninth-grade outcomes and later graduation for students eligible for the pilot. Both studies examine a specific high-fidelity San Francisco implementation, so the proposition invites debate about replication, implementation, and scale rather than claiming a universal effect.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "da4a6c1f9d4446f9832ff3b49a4400ef"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "value": false
        }
      }
    ],
